1 REM FBCS GFX-0088
2 REM CLAIM A-13.5.4-06
3 REM TYPE GRAPHIC
100 PRINT "GFX-0088 TRANSFORM TERMS LEFT TO RIGHT, NESTED PICTURE FIRST (13.5.4)"
110 DECLARE PICTURE OUTER, INNER, P2
120 DRAW OUTER WITH SHIFT(10,0)
130 DIM M1(4,4), M2(4,4)
140 MAT M1 = SHIFT(1,0)
150 MAT M2 = SCALE(2)
160 DRAW P2 WITH M1*M2
170 STOP
200 PICTURE OUTER
210 DRAW INNER WITH SHIFT(0,5)
220 END PICTURE
300 PICTURE INNER
310 PLOT LINES: 1,1; 2,2;
320 END PICTURE
400 PICTURE P2
410 PLOT LINES: 1,1; 2,2;
420 END PICTURE
999 END
